MODULE: AggregateConvergesCrashSkipsReplay
TARGET: AggregateConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a crash resumes from speculative read progress and discards its unflushed prepares
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ read' = checkpoint /\ staged' = {} /\ rebuilding' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ read' = read /\ staged' = {} /\ rebuilding' = FALSE
--- END
